# Healthcare Analysis

This project focuses on analyzing customer churn using a public dataset.

The purpose of this project is to understand customer behavior and identify basic patterns related to churn.

---

## Scope of Work
- Data cleaning and preprocessing using Excel
- Checking duplicates and organizing the dataset
- Creating simple visualizations using Power BI

